{"start": 382.31, "end": 383.81, "text": "that exhausts you in this marriage.", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 383.81, "end": 386.03, "text": "And it can be something real small, real little,", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 386.03, "end": 390.09, "text": "that just like, nails on a chalkboard when it takes place,", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 390.09, "end": 393.09, "text": "because we're at each other's throats on too many areas.", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 393.09, "end": 394.85, "text": "You pick it, and I'm gonna show you", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 394.85, "end": 396.95, "text": "how we can have fun with it.", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 396.95, "end": 399.55, "text": "I said, game on, I'm ready for this.", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 399.55, "end": 400.39, "text": "And this is what I told her, I said,", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 400.39, "end": 401.83, "text": "babe, there's not a lot of adventure", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 401.83, "end": 404.75, "text": "left for men in the world anymore.", "avg_logprob": -0.1052, "no_speech_prob": 0.0021, "compression_ratio": 1.6733}
{"start": 404.75, "end": 422.96, "text": "Would you please let me find my own parking space?", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 422.96, "end": 426.13, "text": "I want to do it all by myself.", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 426.13, "end": 430.81, "text": "I want to provide this for my family.", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 430.81, "end": 432.61, "text": "And you know what my wife said?", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 432.61, "end": 434.48, "text": "Game on.", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 434.48, "end": 435.16, "text": "Game on.", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 435.16, "end": 438.54, "text": "You know what she does now when we pull into a parking lot?", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 438.54, "end": 441.24, "text": "She knows if she looks at a spot,", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 441.24, "end": 446.36, "text": "it automatically disqualifies that spot.", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 446.36, "end": 448.08, "text": "But she used to look at me with those eyes", "avg_logprob": -0.12, "no_speech_prob": 0.0045, "compression_ratio": 1.5917}
{"start": 448.08, "end": 451.33, "text": "it said, you stubborn, stubborn man.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 451.33, "end": 452.93, "text": "Not anymore.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 452.93, "end": 455.69, "text": "Now when we pull into a space that I found,", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 455.69, "end": 460.82, "text": "20 spaces away from her third space from the door.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 460.82, "end": 462.3, "text": "I love this about her.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 462.3, "end": 467.26, "text": "She leans over and she starts massaging my bicep.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 467.26, "end": 483.04, "text": "And she'll say, I'm so proud of you.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 483.04, "end": 486.52, "text": "Kids, doesn't your dad do a great job finding parking spaces?", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 486.52, "end": 488.08, "text": "I return the favor.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 488.08, "end": 491.48, "text": "I'm like, this is exactly how this is supposed to work.", "avg_logprob": -0.136, "no_speech_prob": 0.0901, "compression_ratio": 1.5373}
{"start": 491.48, "end": 493.64, "text": "enjoying life together.", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 493.64, "end": 494.96, "text": "What would your marriage look like", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 494.96, "end": 496.92, "text": "if you took every irritating, frustrating,", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 496.92, "end": 500.41, "text": "annoying thing and turned it into fun?", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 500.41, "end": 501.27, "text": "The things that you just,", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 501.27, "end": 502.51, "text": "just think of something right now", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 502.51, "end": 504.69, "text": "that if I were to mention anything", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
{"start": 504.69, "end": 506.99, "text": "from driving to parking spaces to shopping", "avg_logprob": -0.1336, "no_speech_prob": 0.0189, "compression_ratio": 1.7477}
