{"start": 522.98, "end": 525.66, "text": "why you would think I would have an answer for you on that.", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
{"start": 525.66, "end": 529.42, "text": "I don't, I never studied that, I don't have a degree in that.", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
{"start": 529.42, "end": 531.22, "text": "We would drive through construction zones", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
{"start": 531.22, "end": 534.88, "text": "and Amy would be like, hey babe, yeah,", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
{"start": 534.88, "end": 536.38, "text": "what are they doing right here?", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
{"start": 539.39, "end": 552.44, "text": "Let's see, right there.", "avg_logprob": -0.2002, "no_speech_prob": 0.1193, "compression_ratio": 1.6667}
