{"start": 573.06, "end": 578.69, "text": "and have fun with the questions that she asked while we're driving.", "avg_logprob": -0.1122, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 1.7092}
{"start": 578.69, "end": 581.05, "text": "Because we used to drive down the road and she would go, what are you thinking about", "avg_logprob": -0.1122, "no_speech_prob": 0.0023, "compression_ratio": 1.7092}
